                <pb facs="0362" n="242" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg242"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-03-21"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 21,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Russell reports that the claim of the Compañia Fluvial de Cartagena et al.
                    against the Government of Colombia has been settled by that government by an
                    offer of $475,000 in bonds, which was accepted by the agent of the
                    companies.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
